<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire eyes two Manila condominiums.</title>
<headline>Empire eyes two Manila condominiums.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate firm Empire East Land Holdings Inc said on Thursday it planned to develop two condominium buildings in Manila's upscale districts.</p>
<p>The company said it recently signed a memorandum of agreement with a local company to develop a medium-rise condominium building in Manila's suburb Mandaluyong.</p>
<p>&quot;The condominium will be sold at an affordable price to a middle-income market,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added it would develop more than one hectare property in the Greenhills district into a mixed use residential and commercial centre.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
